# Which pyseer settings do they use?
Pyseer v1.3.524 was used to run the GWAS using the linear mixed model (LMM) to account for population structure. The kinship matrix for LMM is calculated from the phylogenic tree using PySeer’s script phylogeny_distance.py and thus is kept the same for all GWAS analyses (SNP, burden testing and pan-genome GWAS) applied to the same population.

